<mat-card class="cardWithShadow">
      <mat-card-content class="p-y-24">
          <mat-card-title>Caractéristiques du logement</mat-card-title>
          <div class="row p-t-24">
              <div class="col-lg-6 d-flex align-items-center p-y-16">
                  <span
                      class="text-warning bg-light-accent rounded icon-40 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">
                      <i-tabler name="map-pin" class="icon-18 d-flex"></i-tabler>
                  </span>

                  <div class="m-l-16 m-r-auto">
                      <h6 class="mat-body-2 f-w-600">{{ adsDetail[0].accomAddress }}</h6>
                      <span class="mat-body-1">{{ adsDetail[0].city.name }}, {{ adsDetail[0].country.name
                          }}</span>
                  </div>

              </div>

              <div class="col-lg-6 d-flex align-items-center p-y-16">
                  <span
                      class="text-warning bg-light-accent rounded icon-40 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">
                      <i-tabler name="building-community" class="icon-18 d-flex"></i-tabler>
                  </span>

                  <div class="m-l-16 m-r-auto">
                      <h6 class="mat-body-2 f-w-600">{{ adsDetail[0].surface }}m² au total</h6>
                      <span class="mat-body-1">{{ adsDetail[0].numberOfRoom }} pièces - {{
                          adsDetail[0].numberOfBathrooms }} salle de bains - {{
                          adsDetail[0].numberOfBedrooms }} chambres</span>
                  </div>

              </div>

              <div class="col-lg-6 d-flex align-items-center p-y-16">
                  <span
                      class="text-warning bg-light-accent rounded icon-40 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center">
                      <i-tabler name="device-desktop-plus" class="icon-18 d-flex"></i-tabler>
                  </span>

                  <div class="m-l-16 m-r-auto">
                      <!-- <h6 class="mat-body-2 f-w-600">{{ adsDetail[0].accomAddress }}</h6> -->
                      <!-- <span *ngFor="let equipmnt of adsDetail[0].equipment">
                          {{equipmnt.equipment}}
                       </span> -->

                      <div>
                          <span
                              *ngFor="let equipmnt of adsDetail[0]?.equipment?.slice(0, 2); let i = index">
                              {{equipmnt.equipment}}{{i < 1 ? ', ' : ', ...' }} </span>
                      </div>

                      <span class="mat-body-1">
                          {{ adsDetail[0].equipment.length }} équipements inclus <a [routerLink]=""
                              class="text-primary">voir plus</a>
                      </span>
                  </div>

              </div>
          </div>

      </mat-card-content>
      <mat-card-content class="p-24">
          <mat-card-title>Description</mat-card-title>
          <p class="mat-body-1 m-t-16">
              But you cannot figure out what it is or what it can do. MTA web directory
              is the simplest way in which one can bid on a link, or a few links if they
              wish to do so. The link directory on MTA displays all of the links it
              currently has, and does so in alphabetical order, which makes it much
              easier for someone to find what they are looking for if it is something
              specific and they do not want to go through all the other sites and links
              as well. It allows you to start your bid at the bottom and slowly work
              your way to the top of the list.
          </p>

      </mat-card-content>
</mat-card>

